,"status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m002-0154","start":154,"end":155,"surface":"冉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004197","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m002-0164","start":164,"end":166,"surface":"季君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004206","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m002-0171","start":171,"end":174,"surface":"武王后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004196","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m002-0178","start":178,"end":180,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004198","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m002-0180","start":180,"end":183,"surface":"諸兄弟","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"族屬、群體或親屬回指暫留未解，不補父親及群體成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m002-0195","start":195,"end":197,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004198","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m002-0199","start":199,"end":202,"surface":"宣太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004199","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m002-0206","start":206,"end":208,"surface":"魏冉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004197","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-072-rang","book_id":"b-shiji-072","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-072-rang"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:p007","text":"穰侯，華陽君，昭王母宣太后之弟也；而涇陽君、高陵君皆昭王同母弟也。穰侯相，三人者更將，有封邑，以太后故，私家富重於王室。及穰侯為秦將，且欲越韓、魏而伐齊綱壽，欲以廣其陶封。范睢乃上書曰：","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m007-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"穰侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004482","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m007-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"華陽君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004483","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m007-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004480","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m007-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"宣太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004484","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m007-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"涇陽君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004485","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m007-0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"高陵君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004486","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m007-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004480","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m007-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"穰侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004482","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m007-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"三人者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名角色或泛論保存，文武合稱不補個人錨點；韓盧犬喻不當人物，王者泛論不套秦昭王。"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m007-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004484","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m007-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"私家","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名角色或泛論保存，文武合稱不補個人錨點；韓盧犬喻不當人物，王者泛論不套秦昭王。"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m007-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"穰侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004482","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m007-0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"范睢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004472","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-079-fancai","book_id":"b-shiji-079","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-079-fancai"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:p017","text":"范睢日益親，復說用數年矣，因請閒說曰：「臣居山東時，聞齊之有田文，不聞其有王也；聞秦之有太后、穰侯、華陽、高陵、涇陽，不聞其有王也。夫擅國之謂王，能利害之謂王，制殺生之威之謂王。今太后擅行不顧，穰侯出使不報，華陽、涇陽等擊斷無諱，高陵進退不請。四貴備而國不危者，未之有也。為此四貴者下，乃所謂無王也。然則權安得不傾，令安得從王出乎？臣聞善治國者，乃內固其威而外重其權。穰侯使者操王之重，決制於諸侯，剖符於天下，政適伐國，莫敢不聽。戰勝攻取則利歸於陶，國獘御於諸侯；戰敗則結怨於百姓，而禍歸於社稷。《詩》曰『木實繁者披其枝，披其枝者傷其心；大其都者危其國，尊其臣者卑其主』。崔杼、淖齒管齊，射王股，擢王筋，縣之於廟梁，宿昔而死。李兌管趙，囚主父於沙丘，百日而餓死。今臣聞秦太后、穰侯用事，高陵、華陽、涇陽佐之，卒無秦王，此亦淖齒、李兌之類也。且夫三代所以亡國者，君專授政，縱酒馳騁弋獵，不聽政事。其所授者，妒賢嫉能，御下蔽上，以成其私，不為主計，而主不覺悟，故失其國。今自有秩以上至諸大吏，下及王左右，無非相國之人者。見王獨立於朝，臣竊為王恐，萬世之後，有秦國者非王子孫也。」昭王聞之大懼，曰：「善。」於是廢太后，逐穰侯、高陵、華陽、涇陽君於關外。秦王乃拜范睢為相。收穰侯之印，使歸陶，因使縣官給車牛以徙，千乘有餘。到關，關閱其寶器，寶器珍怪多於王室。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m017-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"范睢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004472","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m017-0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004472","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m017-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"田文","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004505","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m017-0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"齊王未定、王權泛論或合敘不同引古王，不強接秦昭與齊湣。"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m017-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004484","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m017-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"穰侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004482","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m017-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"華陽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004483","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m017-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"高陵","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004486","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m017-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"涇陽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004485","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m017-0063","start":63,"end":64,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004480","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m017-0071","start":71,"end":72,"surface":"王","kind":"un